1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,770
You brothers

10
00:01:40,790 --> 00:01:42,130
will have plenty of time

11
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:43,410
to mend the bonds later.

12
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:44,290
Right now, we must

13
00:01:44,310 --> 00:01:47,100
make good use of this victory.

14
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,260
Who

15
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:51,180
stopped you from finding your Senior?

16
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:53,900
Once you become King of East Sea,

17
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,930
and with the Celestial Court's help,

18
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:57,100
finding someone will be effortless.

19
00:01:57,790 --> 00:02:01,740
And who washed away
all your spiritual power,

20
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,130
and put you through such suffering?

21
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,900
This is a tough spot.

22
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,690
No worries.

23
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,730
Switching to Deep Clean mode.

24
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,290
Here you go.

25
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,340
How is that possible?

26
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:34,780
How

27
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,980
could it be him?

28
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:39,690
Your Highness.

29
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:41,660
Your sense of smell

30
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,500
should be back by now.

31
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:46,540
Why not try

32
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,410
sniffing out

33
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:52,690
who he really is?

34
00:02:56,190 --> 00:02:57,610
Changshou.

35
00:02:57,630 --> 00:02:58,340
He's breathing.

36
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,570
Your Highness.

37
00:02:59,630 --> 00:03:00,540
I'm Li Changshou.

38
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,500
Changshou.

39
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:03,690
I am Li Changshou.

40
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:05,610
Get closer to me.

41
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,100
You're Changgeng.

42
00:03:17,430 --> 00:03:17,850
He...

43
00:03:18,190 --> 00:03:19,610
He just woke up. How's he out again?

44
00:03:24,630 --> 00:03:25,410
Yunxiao?

45
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:27,890
Yunxiao.

46
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,380
How is it?

47
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,890
Did you see Jin Chan?

48
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,450
Yunxiao?

49
00:03:55,430 --> 00:03:56,570
She's not Yunxiao.

50
00:03:56,590 --> 00:03:58,340
She was my Master a thousand years ago.

51
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,220
The Demon Emperor, Taiyi.

52
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,290
Ao Guang greets Master.

53
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,890
You shameless traitor.

54
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,610
You dare to show your face again?

55
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,980
The terror from 1,000 years ago,

56
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,780
do you still remember?

57
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,540
Moon Elder, go get the painting.

58
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:27,100
You are right.

59
00:04:27,190 --> 00:04:29,700
I betrayed you all those years ago.

60
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:31,540
My crimes deserve a thousand deaths.

61
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,020
But today,

62
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,540
I am willing to redeem myself.

63
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,540
I will follow you, Master.

64
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:38,290
Even if it costs my life.

65
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,580
Your Majesty.

66
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,290
Your Majesty.

67
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,580
Your Majesty.

68
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,170
A fake.

69
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,980
These days,

70
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,540
who doesn't keep a guard up?

71
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:45,900
Scatter.

72
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:19,490
What a fine sword.

73
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,930
It has been a thousand years.

74
00:06:23,420 --> 00:06:26,340
[Episode 27]

75
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,250
Your Highness.

76
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:40,730
You've already lost.

77
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:42,580
Why bother resisting?

78
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:44,290
Both of you

79
00:06:45,510 --> 00:06:47,980
are going to die.

80
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:52,540
Your Highness.

81
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,220
At last, before I die,

82
00:06:57,510 --> 00:06:59,290
I see you as you once were.

83
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,290
Don't talk nonsense.

84
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:03,540
You won't die.

85
00:07:04,190 --> 00:07:05,170
I'll protect you.

86
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,490
Your Highness.

87
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:18,610
Seeing you return like this,

88
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,370
I can die with no regrets.

89
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:28,780
Si'er,

90
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,900
that's why you need to stay alive.

91
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,220
We still have

92
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,980
so much time ahead of us.

93
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,980
I have to make it up to you, slowly.

94
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,580
Done with your last words?

95
00:07:47,510 --> 00:07:49,340
Then I'm about to strike.

96
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,490
Live on.

97
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,780
Your Highness.

98
00:07:56,780 --> 00:08:03,890
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

99
00:08:04,390 --> 00:08:11,890
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

100
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:12,810
Your Highness.

101
00:08:13,390 --> 00:08:14,050
You...

102
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,730
Dragon Transformation?

103
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,170
Your Highness.

104
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,610
You are gravely wounded.

105
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,370
If you force the transformation,

106
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:28,340
aren't you afraid your spiritual power

107
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,980
will collapse and kill you?

108
00:08:31,310 --> 00:08:32,100
No.

109
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:34,610
You can't control me now.

110
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,610
Are you afraid?

111
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,700
I, Ao Jia,

112
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:42,180
was bound by your Demonic Arts

113
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:45,700
and committed countless sins.

114
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:47,300
Consider this

115
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,980
my way of making amends.

116
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:55,580
Your Highness,

117
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,580
are you going

118
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,890
to take us both down?

119
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,180
To take the true culprit with me

120
00:09:03,630 --> 00:09:04,420
is worth it.

121
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,770
Your Highness.

122
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:09,700
Si'er, run!

123
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,460
Your Highness.

124
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,010
I won't leave you.

125
00:09:13,030 --> 00:09:13,890
Stay back.

126
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:15,220
Go find Ao Yi immediately.

127
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,490
He must still be alive.

128
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,700
Tell him,

129
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,100
his brother has failed.

130
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:24,010
The East Sea Dragon Clan

131
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:26,730
now rests on his shoulders.

132
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:29,940
Go!

133
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:31,940
No.

134
00:09:32,390 --> 00:09:33,180
Go!

135
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,180
Now!

136
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:47,240
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

137
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:47,980
Your Highness.

138
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:50,130
Such noble resolve.

139
00:09:55,270 --> 00:10:02,120
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

140
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:09,680
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

141
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:16,680
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

142
00:10:16,910 --> 00:10:18,530
Ao Jia!

143
00:10:18,530 --> 00:10:24,760
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

144
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:31,610
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

145
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:37,980
Pity, such a pity.

146
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,300
Such a brave young man.

147
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,700
Yet he couldn't escape destiny.

148
00:10:55,910 --> 00:10:57,610
Truly a fine vessel.

149
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:01,100
Saves me quite some effort.

150
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:10,370
Leave Yunxiao's body.

151
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,820
Most people tremble

152
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,490
at the sight of me.

153
00:11:25,750 --> 00:11:27,010
Yet you dare resist?

154
00:11:27,030 --> 00:11:28,940
Get out now.

155
00:11:30,510 --> 00:11:32,300
The Pregenesis Sword is in my hand.

156
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:34,340
Keeping you is now pointless.

157
00:11:39,790 --> 00:11:41,610
To die at my hand

158
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:43,130
is your honor.

159
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,300
You dare defy me?

160
00:11:59,510 --> 00:12:01,130
Little brat, run.

161
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,700
Yunxiao.

162
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,530
For him,

163
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,940
you'd resist so stubbornly.

164
00:12:20,790 --> 00:12:22,100
How amusing.

165
00:12:35,910 --> 00:12:36,730
Senior...

166
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,490
Senior...

167
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,010
It's you.

168
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,130
Why are you in my wedding dress?

169
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,610
You're the Westdawn assassin?

170
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:01,980
No.

171
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,300
Let go.

172
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:04,770
Where's Ao Yi?

173
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:08,100
I'm asking you, where's Ao Yi?

174
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,300
None of your concern.

175
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:10,770
Who are you?

176
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,820
Why come to the East Sea?

177
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,220
I came for revenge.

178
00:13:15,150 --> 00:13:16,530
You killed Ao Yi?

179
00:13:18,630 --> 00:13:19,490
Didn't you?

180
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:46,890
Ao Yi can still be saved.

181
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:00,300
Your Majesty.

182
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,530
Please be careful, Your Majesty.

183
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,340
Turtle.

184
00:14:09,550 --> 00:14:10,730
I am truly useless.

185
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,180
It seems

186
00:14:14,630 --> 00:14:16,300
I'm so old.

187
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:20,130
No. Your Majesty is ever mighty,

188
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,130
and full of vigor.

189
00:14:21,150 --> 00:14:21,890
Enough.

190
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,420
At a time like this,

191
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,610
stop flattering me.

192
00:14:26,550 --> 00:14:27,890
I know it well.

193
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:31,610
I've ruled the East Sea
for a thousand years.

194
00:14:31,630 --> 00:14:35,220
I thought I could outplay everyone

195
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,890
and always come out on top.

196
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,010
But the truth is,

197
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,700
I lost this game

198
00:14:43,030 --> 00:14:45,300
long ago.

199
00:14:46,910 --> 00:14:50,180
I was just too arrogant to see it,

200
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:53,100
so sure I had already won.

201
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:58,460
Your Majesty.

202
00:14:59,030 --> 00:15:01,010
I made your decoction.

203
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,300
It's almost cold.

204
00:15:02,390 --> 00:15:03,220
Take it while it's warm.

205
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:10,890
What happened
to you and Yunxiao out there?

206
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:11,610
How dare you?

207
00:15:11,870 --> 00:15:12,610
Turtle.

208
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:14,770
What?

209
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:18,180
The real Pregenesis Sword fragment

210
00:15:18,510 --> 00:15:20,730
was stolen by that Demon Emperor?

211
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:22,300
I'm asking you.

212
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:24,940
Wasn't that Demon Emperor
sealed beneath the Eye of the Sea?

213
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:25,940
He was.

214
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,890
Then why is he possessing Yunxiao?

215
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,980
How much do you know
of the Demon Emperor?

216
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:33,010
You think that was the Demon Emperor

217
00:15:33,030 --> 00:15:34,890
at full strength?

218
00:15:34,910 --> 00:15:36,100
You're wrong.

219
00:15:36,910 --> 00:15:38,580
That was only a thousandth

220
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:41,370
of the power he had
a thousand years ago.

221
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,130
A thousand years ago,

222
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,580
this place

223
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:57,100
was the Demon Emperor's palace.

224
00:15:57,150 --> 00:15:59,980
He united all the demons under his rule,

225
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:03,580
leaving a trail of blood and death

226
00:16:03,910 --> 00:16:06,300
across the Three Realms.

227
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:09,770
The Demon Emperor was mighty,

228
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:12,060
and ruthless beyond measure.

229
00:16:12,510 --> 00:16:15,730
He used the Pregenesis Sword

230
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:18,180
to counter human magic.

231
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:20,890
Even the Three Sects joined forces,

232
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:23,700
yet still could not defeat him.

233
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,580
Back then,

234
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:27,900
[Demon Emperor Taiyi,]
I was

235
00:16:27,900 --> 00:16:29,520
[Lord of Ancient Demon Court]
his chief general.

236
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:31,010
But deep down,

237
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:34,250
I was terrified

238
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:37,010
of that ruthless tyrant.

239
00:16:37,390 --> 00:16:38,610
Then came the great battle.

240
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:41,340
Grand Mage Voidcity used his power

241
00:16:41,630 --> 00:16:45,220
to take the Pregenesis Sword
from the Demon Emperor.

242
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,420
With the Human Clan's aid

243
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,820
and my betrayal,

244
00:16:49,030 --> 00:16:51,340
we barely defeated him.

245
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:55,460
Grand Mage Voidcity
used the Sea-Calming Pillar

246
00:16:55,790 --> 00:16:57,300
to seal the Demon Emperor's body

247
00:16:57,720 --> 00:17:01,820
beneath the Eye of the East Sea.

248
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:13,900
But at that time, no one noticed

249
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:17,900
the Demon Emperor left a strand of hair

250
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:21,620
stuck to Voidcity.

251
00:17:21,830 --> 00:17:23,380
That hair carried

252
00:17:23,510 --> 00:17:27,940
a fragment of his soul.

253
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,700
Years later,

254
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,090
I learned

255
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:32,730
that the strand had

256
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:34,700
escaped the East Sea

257
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:39,420
and hidden in the mountains
in Cattle Land,

258
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,700
where it became a golden lotus.

259
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:44,090
The Demon Emperor's soul

260
00:17:44,110 --> 00:17:46,700
was hidden inside it

261
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:48,900
for 1,000 years.

262
00:17:49,310 --> 00:17:50,490
Until one day,

263
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:52,700
someone picked that lotus.

264
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:53,940
Who?

265
00:17:54,830 --> 00:17:56,730
I only found out today.

266
00:17:57,550 --> 00:17:59,380
The one who took it

267
00:18:00,510 --> 00:18:02,290
was Jin Chan.

268
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:04,490
Jin Chan set a deadly trap.

269
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:06,220
He opened the lotus

270
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:09,290
and released the Demon Emperor's soul.

271
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:13,380
It possessed Fairy Yunxiao's body.

272
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:16,140
But that fragment of his soul

273
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:19,810
can't wield his full power.

274
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,490
For a thousand years,

275
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:26,490
the Demon Emperor's body's

276
00:18:26,590 --> 00:18:28,090
thrashed and roared beneath,

277
00:18:28,110 --> 00:18:31,380
raging against his defeat.

278
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:33,010
He wants to fight again.

279
00:18:33,030 --> 00:18:35,380
He wants back everything he lost.

280
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:39,660
And he wants to rebuild a Demon Realm

281
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:43,010
where his kind rules the world.

282
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:06,820
[Forbidden]

283
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:08,290
Once the Eye of the Sea is opened,

284
00:19:08,590 --> 00:19:11,570
his soul will burst forth

285
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:14,810
and fully possess Fairy Yunxiao's body.

286
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:16,900
By then,

287
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:20,220
the East Sea will fall.

288
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:24,620
It will be a Great Tribulation.

289
00:19:25,590 --> 00:19:27,420
Why didn't you stop him at that time?

290
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,380
Stop him?

291
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:33,940
Only one-thousandth of his power

292
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,490
left us both badly hurt.

293
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:38,380
Looks like

294
00:19:38,590 --> 00:19:40,860
you truly have no idea

295
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:43,570
how terrifying the Demon Emperor is.

296
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,290
Yi.

297
00:20:00,590 --> 00:20:02,900
I truly did all I could.

298
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:12,490
I have guarded the East Sea

299
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:14,490
for a thousand years,

300
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:18,900
yet in the end, the East Sea

301
00:20:19,310 --> 00:20:22,220
was still lost at my hands.

302
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:26,530
I was too proud.

303
00:20:27,590 --> 00:20:29,090
I have brought ruin to the East Sea.

304
00:20:31,510 --> 00:20:32,810
I have doomed Jia.

305
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:39,290
And you, Yi.

306
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:41,420
Your Majesty.

307
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:44,900
You must not blame yourself so.

308
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:54,810
Turtle.

309
00:20:57,510 --> 00:20:58,490
Just go.

310
00:20:58,790 --> 00:20:59,570
Your Majesty.

311
00:21:00,550 --> 00:21:03,010
Where do you want me to go?

312
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:04,620
Leave the East Sea.

313
00:21:05,350 --> 00:21:06,700
Find your own safe path.

314
00:21:07,790 --> 00:21:08,900
Your Majesty.

315
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:11,220
What wrong have I done?

316
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:13,770
Why drive me out of the East Sea?

317
00:21:14,030 --> 00:21:15,330
I was wrong.

318
00:21:16,240 --> 00:21:18,220
The East Sea's destruction is near.

319
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:21,380
I am the Dragon King of the East Sea.

320
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:25,770
I must go down with it.

321
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:29,220
But you are different.

322
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:33,940
You smooth-talking Turtle.

323
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:37,490
You'd thrive anywhere you go.

324
00:21:37,790 --> 00:21:39,660
Why must you stay here

325
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:40,810
in the East Sea?

326
00:21:40,830 --> 00:21:41,620
Your Majesty.

327
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:45,220
I've served you a thousand years.

328
00:21:45,590 --> 00:21:46,490
I'd never

329
00:21:46,510 --> 00:21:49,290
find a ruler as wise as you.

330
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:51,010
You won't leave,

331
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:53,180
I won't leave either.

332
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:03,380
You should all leave too.

333
00:22:04,030 --> 00:22:05,290
Destruction of the East Sea

334
00:22:06,310 --> 00:22:07,980
is the Dragon Clan's destiny.

335
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:10,330
But you are different.

336
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:11,730
You can flee.

337
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,860
Then flee.

338
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,420
Flee?

339
00:22:22,510 --> 00:22:23,770
Defend the Crystal Palace.

340
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:25,980
Protect the Dragon King and his son.

341
00:22:31,270 --> 00:22:32,900
Who are you talking to?

342
00:22:36,110 --> 00:22:37,420
Celestial Court soldiers.

343
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,810
What?

344
00:22:52,310 --> 00:22:54,330
How many are there?

345
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:56,730
One hundred thousand.

346
00:22:58,510 --> 00:22:59,380
One hundred thousand?

347
00:23:01,510 --> 00:23:03,090
From now on, Dragon Palace's security

348
00:23:03,310 --> 00:23:05,290
is fully handled by Celestial Court.

349
00:23:05,790 --> 00:23:06,570
Your Majesty.

350
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:09,330
You always believed

351
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:12,090
the Dragon Clan could only survive

352
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:13,380
by staying neutral.

353
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,090
But you forgot

354
00:23:15,110 --> 00:23:16,900
the value of having allies.

355
00:23:17,750 --> 00:23:20,050
Especially against an enemy
you can't defeat alone.

356
00:23:20,590 --> 00:23:21,810
Sometimes, friends are the only ones

357
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:24,050
who can give you a chance to survive.

358
00:23:28,590 --> 00:23:31,700
I realized that far too late.

359
00:23:33,030 --> 00:23:34,660
Now Jia is gone,

360
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:35,770
and Yi…

361
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:38,900
Once I'm gone,

362
00:23:40,590 --> 00:23:42,330
there'll be no heir left

363
00:23:43,550 --> 00:23:45,700
to the East Sea royal family.

364
00:23:47,960 --> 00:23:49,090
Not necessarily.

365
00:23:55,550 --> 00:23:56,900
How dare you show your face?

366
00:23:58,590 --> 00:23:59,380
Your Highness.

367
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:02,090
Wake up. Please.

368
00:24:02,110 --> 00:24:02,530
Stop right there.

369
00:24:02,550 --> 00:24:02,900
Uncle...

370
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,330
Arrest her.

371
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:05,420
Turtle Minister.

372
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,460
Only she can save Ao Yi.

373
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:09,700
She's the one who assassinated him.

374
00:24:09,830 --> 00:24:11,460
How can we let her near him?

375
00:24:36,510 --> 00:24:37,460
Uncle.

376
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,660
Wake up.

377
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:45,250
Uncle.

378
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,420
Uncle.

379
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:00,810
Uncle.

380
00:25:02,510 --> 00:25:03,420
Uncle.

381
00:25:04,510 --> 00:25:05,900
Uncle, where are you?

382
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:06,980
Senior?

383
00:25:14,310 --> 00:25:15,420
Sorry, Senior.

384
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:18,900
I shouldn't have lied to you.

385
00:25:19,110 --> 00:25:20,010
I'm sorry.

386
00:25:20,310 --> 00:25:21,700
I didn't know it was you.

387
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:22,770
That day,

388
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:25,380
I thought the golden dragon ate you.

389
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:28,290
I thought the Dragon Clan
killed my family again.

390
00:25:28,350 --> 00:25:29,490
I wanted revenge.

391
00:25:29,510 --> 00:25:31,090
I wanted to avenge you.

392
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:32,940
It was Changgeng's scheme.

393
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:34,290
Don't be fooled.

394
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:36,050
I thought I was getting my revenge.

395
00:25:36,310 --> 00:25:37,940
I never meant to hurt you.

396
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:38,700
Lies.

397
00:25:38,830 --> 00:25:40,940
All I feel for you is hatred.

398
00:25:41,720 --> 00:25:42,770
Come out, quick.

399
00:25:42,790 --> 00:25:44,420
If you don't, you'll die.

400
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,700
You lied to me.

401
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:47,770
I will only kill you myself.

402
00:25:48,400 --> 00:25:49,290
Uncle.

403
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:51,420
Your brother, Ao Jia,

404
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:52,700
died in battle.

405
00:25:53,510 --> 00:25:54,290
Brother...

406
00:25:56,200 --> 00:25:57,770
Ain't I living just fine?

407
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:00,940
Brother.

408
00:26:00,960 --> 00:26:02,460
This is Changgeng's scheme.

409
00:26:02,750 --> 00:26:03,490
Don't trust him.

410
00:26:03,510 --> 00:26:04,700
Jin Chan killed him.

411
00:26:04,830 --> 00:26:07,460
Jin Chan is Westdawn's spy
in the East Sea.

412
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:08,660
Don't trust her.

413
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:11,090
Don't you trust her.

414
00:26:11,110 --> 00:26:11,940
Uncle.

415
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:14,050
You said you'd change the Dragon Clan.

416
00:26:14,310 --> 00:26:15,940
Right now, the East Sea Dragon Clan

417
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,050
can only rely on you.

418
00:26:17,070 --> 00:26:18,250
What are you still hiding from?

419
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:20,530
I believe you'll
change the Dragon Clan for the better

420
00:26:21,110 --> 00:26:23,050
and make sure
the tragedy never happens again.

421
00:26:23,070 --> 00:26:24,290
I trust only you.

422
00:26:24,480 --> 00:26:26,090
You are the only dragon I trust.

423
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:29,090
I am Ao Yi.

424
00:26:29,160 --> 00:26:32,730
I am Ao Yi, destined to be a light.

425
00:26:38,790 --> 00:26:39,250
He's...

426
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:41,900
Uncle.

427
00:26:42,070 --> 00:26:43,420
You're finally awake.

428
00:26:44,830 --> 00:26:45,620
Senior.

429
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:50,620
What's wrong, Senior?

430
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:53,700
He hasn't quite recovered.

431
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:55,140
Why did you rush at him?

432
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:57,220
Move aside, everyone.

433
00:27:00,350 --> 00:27:01,380
Father?

434
00:27:01,510 --> 00:27:02,460
Yi.

435
00:27:02,750 --> 00:27:03,530
My son.

436
00:27:03,550 --> 00:27:04,250
Father.

437
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:05,900
You finally woke up.

438
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:06,460
Father.

439
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:07,250
Yi.

440
00:27:07,270 --> 00:27:09,420
My good boy.

441
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:11,810
You really scared me.

442
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:13,730
You finally woke up.

443
00:27:13,750 --> 00:27:15,290
Li Changshou.

444
00:27:21,750 --> 00:27:23,700
Your Highness.

445
00:27:24,110 --> 00:27:26,220
About that washing...

446
00:27:26,240 --> 00:27:27,010
Thank you.

447
00:27:28,030 --> 00:27:29,700
You gave me the power I now possess.

448
00:27:31,440 --> 00:27:32,660
You don't blame me for tricking you?

449
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,490
I...

450
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:36,530
I do blame you.

451
00:27:38,270 --> 00:27:39,290
But without you,

452
00:27:39,960 --> 00:27:41,530
I'd forever be just a little dragon.

453
00:27:47,510 --> 00:27:48,290
Good.

454
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:50,660
Perfect timing.

455
00:27:51,110 --> 00:27:52,330
I have a surprise for you.

456
00:27:53,590 --> 00:27:54,380
What surprise?

457
00:27:55,270 --> 00:27:56,010
Moon Elder.

458
00:27:56,030 --> 00:27:56,980
Coming.

459
00:27:57,680 --> 00:27:59,490
Moon Elder is here.

460
00:27:59,790 --> 00:28:02,700
Celestial Descent.

461
00:28:12,310 --> 00:28:13,140
Wrong way.

462
00:28:13,750 --> 00:28:15,810
Celestial Descent.

463
00:28:15,830 --> 00:28:17,010
Holding it in so long.

464
00:28:17,110 --> 00:28:18,490
I can finally come out.

465
00:28:18,590 --> 00:28:19,380
I am...

466
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:22,250
Ke Le'er?

467
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:23,860
Hua?

468
00:28:24,070 --> 00:28:25,290
Long time no see.

469
00:28:26,110 --> 00:28:26,900
Hua.

470
00:28:27,550 --> 00:28:29,290
Weren't you...

471
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:31,140
I'm back to life.

472
00:28:31,310 --> 00:28:32,570
How did you come back to life?

473
00:28:35,750 --> 00:28:36,860
Your Highness.

474
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:38,290
Let me explain to you.

475
00:28:38,590 --> 00:28:41,180
This man right here

476
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:42,620
is not truly human.

477
00:28:46,510 --> 00:28:48,660
I mean, not a mortal.

478
00:28:49,750 --> 00:28:53,490
Dashing and majestic,

479
00:28:53,510 --> 00:28:57,140
he is the ruler of the Celestial Court.
Haotian, the Celestial Emperor.

480
00:29:05,510 --> 00:29:07,490
Ao Yi greets His Majesty.

481
00:29:09,350 --> 00:29:11,290
Ao Guang greets His Majesty.

482
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:14,010
Your Majesty, your visit

483
00:29:14,070 --> 00:29:16,530
honors our East Sea.

484
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:18,220
I... No, no.

485
00:29:18,270 --> 00:29:20,330
On behalf of the East Sea,

486
00:29:20,350 --> 00:29:22,220
I welcome you, Your Majesty.

487
00:29:22,270 --> 00:29:23,050
Dragon King.

488
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:24,700
Please rise.

489
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:26,180
Thank you, Your Majesty.

490
00:29:26,310 --> 00:29:27,090
Ke Le'er.

491
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:27,980
You rise too.

492
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,770
Everyone, please rise.

493
00:29:30,240 --> 00:29:31,010
You can just

494
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:33,010
call me Hua.

495
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:35,380
Hua, let me introduce you.

496
00:29:36,030 --> 00:29:37,090
Minister, Si'er.

497
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:38,290
Senior, come over here.

498
00:29:39,160 --> 00:29:40,250
Allow me to introduce you.

499
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,010
This is Hua,

500
00:29:41,070 --> 00:29:42,940
whom I befriended on Bear Island.

501
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:46,250
This is Jiang Si'er of the Mermaid Clan.

502
00:29:46,270 --> 00:29:47,050
Buddy,

503
00:29:48,550 --> 00:29:50,770
you arranged all of this, didn't you?

504
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,250
Did you arrange

505
00:29:53,270 --> 00:29:55,010
for Celestial Emperor to appear here

506
00:29:55,310 --> 00:29:56,570
to meet my son?

507
00:29:57,000 --> 00:29:57,770
What?

508
00:29:58,480 --> 00:29:59,380
Not happy about it?

509
00:30:00,110 --> 00:30:01,700
How could I not be happy?

510
00:30:04,270 --> 00:30:05,250
Right now,

511
00:30:05,270 --> 00:30:07,180
the East Sea has Celestial Court's aid.

512
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:09,380
Even if East Sea falls,

513
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:12,050
our clan still has somewhere to go.

514
00:30:12,070 --> 00:30:14,180
I can't thank you enough.

515
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:18,490
Alright, tell me.

516
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,620
What's your escape plan next?

517
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,730
Who said I'm escaping?

518
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:26,860
You...

519
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:28,700
I'll face the Demon Emperor head-on.

520
00:30:31,110 --> 00:30:32,460
Did you forget

521
00:30:32,640 --> 00:30:34,180
everything I told you?

522
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:35,980
I didn't.

523
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,570
You're right.

524
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:41,180
If I mean to flee,

525
00:30:42,200 --> 00:30:44,460
now is indeed the best time.

526
00:30:46,030 --> 00:30:47,660
The old me

527
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:50,730
would've bolted long ago.

528
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:52,180
Then why didn't you?

529
00:30:52,550 --> 00:30:54,050
But it's the Demon Emperor.

530
00:30:54,350 --> 00:30:55,980
He just had to pick someone

531
00:30:58,000 --> 00:30:59,730
he shouldn't have.

532
00:31:42,350 --> 00:31:44,010
Petty trick.

533
00:32:24,790 --> 00:32:25,900
Li Changshou.

534
00:32:28,200 --> 00:32:29,700
Long time no see.

535
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:31,900
Who are

536
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:34,180
you again?

537
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,180
You forgot me.

538
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:45,770
But I've never forgotten you.

539
00:32:51,030 --> 00:32:52,570
My hatred for you

540
00:32:54,350 --> 00:32:56,900
woke me from hell.

541
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,220
Burst.

542
00:33:12,350 --> 00:33:14,180
Villains die from talking too much.

543
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:15,700
Keep that in mind.

544
00:33:19,110 --> 00:33:19,900
Li Changshou,

545
00:33:20,510 --> 00:33:21,940
I'm the karma of your sins,

546
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:23,220
the one thing you failed to foresee,

547
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:25,290
your never-ending nightmare.

548
00:33:26,590 --> 00:33:28,050
In this undead body,

549
00:33:28,070 --> 00:33:29,380
I will forever and ever...

550
00:33:31,590 --> 00:33:33,180
Can you let me finish?

551
00:33:38,310 --> 00:33:40,620
This guy does feel familiar.

552
00:33:41,550 --> 00:33:43,220
Who was he?

553
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:48,770
I can't recall.

554
00:33:49,310 --> 00:33:50,180
Forget it. Not important.

555
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:57,330
Ascendance Sect's move?

556
00:34:03,510 --> 00:34:04,290
Good.

557
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:06,700
Enough talk. Let's fight.

558
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:17,980
Your opponent is me.

559
00:34:18,590 --> 00:34:19,860
Get out of my way.

560
00:34:26,840 --> 00:34:27,900
Why?

561
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:31,860
Why can I never beat you?

562
00:34:33,190 --> 00:34:35,420
I refuse to accept it.

563
00:34:36,190 --> 00:34:37,050
That's a wrap for you.

564
00:34:38,670 --> 00:34:42,570
I refuse to accept it!

565
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:49,610
Yunxiao.

566
00:35:11,760 --> 00:35:12,570
Your Majesty.

567
00:35:12,590 --> 00:35:13,820
What's going on?

568
00:35:14,030 --> 00:35:15,260
The Great Tribulation

569
00:35:15,590 --> 00:35:16,780
has begun.

570
00:35:37,590 --> 00:35:38,780
I've waited for this moment

571
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:41,010
for ages.

572
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:43,170
Now, Fairy Yunxiao.

573
00:35:44,110 --> 00:35:45,860
Let it all begin.

574
00:36:24,230 --> 00:36:25,490
A thousand years.

575
00:36:26,670 --> 00:36:28,010
Time to wake up.

576
00:37:59,190 --> 00:38:00,420
Finally, we meet.

577
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:02,570
Chosen One of Fate.

578
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:05,610
I am Jin Chan.

579
00:38:40,660 --> 00:38:46,440
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

580
00:38:47,110 --> 00:38:53,810
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

581
00:38:55,340 --> 00:39:01,390
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

582
00:39:02,020 --> 00:39:08,470
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

583
00:39:09,210 --> 00:39:16,330
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

584
00:39:16,710 --> 00:39:23,610
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

